; implicit_prices emits a price from the cost of a posting that does not
; reduce its lot. A posting booked against a lot of its own sign, which
; STRICT matches by label here, makes that lot larger: it is no reduction,
; and its price is emitted on its own date.
plugin "beancount.plugins.implicit_prices"

2020-01-01 open Assets:I
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "a short lot and a long one"
  Assets:I  -1 HOOL {100 USD, "a"}
  Assets:I   1 HOOL {100 USD, "b"}

2020-01-03 * "more of the short lot"
  Assets:I  -1 HOOL {"a"}
  Assets:Cash  100 USD

2020-01-04 * "less of the long lot"
  Assets:I  -1 HOOL {"b"}
  Assets:Cash  100 USD
